    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The sigil and mist shapes, the cone's streaks and the sinking motes change per cast. The waves stay 400 ms apart."
  },
  "director_notes": "From Lisa's spells01 image, Bard - Dirge: violet sound waves that weaken enemies. The dark twin of Rallying Anthem: the same downbeat waves, aimed. Arcs (ring arc_deg) carry the sound across the ground toward the target, a wind-style beam gives the streaming cone, and upright rings show the sound in the side view. On the target, mist that sinks (negative rise_speed) and motes that fall (positive gravity) read as being weakened, the opposite of the anthem's rising motes."
}
